miniprogram_dist/rive is built by scripts/cyl_build.js from @rive-app/canvas-advanced 2.39.1
(https://github.com/rive-app/rive-wasm, MIT, Copyright (c) 2020-2021 Rive; license in miniprogram_dist/rive/LICENSE):
canvas_advanced.js is canvas_advanced.mjs turned into CommonJS with mini program shims declared before it, and
rive.wasm.br is rive.wasm compressed with Brotli.

The approach (a 2D canvas, the canvas-advanced runtime, WXWebAssembly with a Brotli WebAssembly in the package) follows
the README of RiveViewer-miniapp (CrossPlatform/RiveViewer-miniapp); none of its code, which is licensed
PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0, is included.
